# texture-execution

## Overview
Functional capability to create textures, materials, and PBR maps for 3D assets programmatically.

## When to Use
- Creating PBR materials for game engines
- UV unwrapping 3D models
- Generating procedural textures
- Baking textures from high-poly to low-poly
- Setting up shaders

## Texture Types

### PBR Map Types
| Map | Purpose | Channels |
|-----|---------|----------|
| Albedo/Diffuse | Base color | RGB |
| Normal | Surface direction | RGB (encoded) |
| Roughness | Surface smoothness | Grayscale |
| Metallic | Metal vs dielectric | Grayscale |
| AO | Ambient occlusion | Grayscale |
| Height | Displacement | Grayscale |
| Emissive | Self-illumination | RGB |

### Creating PBR Textures
```javascript
